WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.153 --> 00:00:02.073
I gave up my leg for that catch. It was a catch

00:00:02.073 --> 00:00:03.073
We should have four wins

00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:04.024
Hmm

00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:07.379
Screw it. It's time I take this to Challenge Court!

00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:13.074
ALL RISE! ...or kneel...or

00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:14.729
Yeah, we don't need to go there. OK, proceed.

00:00:14.729 --> 00:00:17.175
Receivers and corners of the jury, Exhibit A

00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:18.455
Now does Mr. Miller ever gain full control

00:00:18.455 --> 00:00:18.985
of the football?

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:19.632
(Gasp)

00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:21.478
OK now technically the rule states that in order...

00:00:21.478 --> 00:00:22.840
for a catch you need a football move...

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.801
But now they changed...

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:24.840
Needs to be two feet in bounds...

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.548
That's a good question!

00:00:25.548 --> 00:00:26.284
What is the ground?

00:00:26.284 --> 00:00:27.886
In conclusion he never became a runner, so

00:00:27.905 --> 00:00:29.091
therefore not a catch

00:00:29.091 --> 00:00:31.093
Mannn, what the f--k does that mean?

00:00:31.093 --> 00:00:32.277
I get it, Dez.

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:35.259
Now I'm not some hotshot TV ref

00:00:35.259 --> 00:00:36.914
I'm a man of the people

00:00:36.914 --> 00:00:40.326
So my first witness is...100 guys at a bar!

00:00:40.326 --> 00:00:42.062
Gentlemen, was that a catch?

00:00:42.062 --> 00:00:43.062
Hell yeah that's a catch!

00:00:44.819 --> 00:00:46.581
IF THE BALL DOES NOT FALL,

00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:47.666
CATCH IS THE CALL!

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.666
Jury, have you come to a decision?

00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:50.572
Yeah, we've decided we have, uh, no idea

00:00:50.572 --> 00:00:51.226
what a catch is

00:00:51.226 --> 00:00:52.922
Well in that case the NFL defaults to the less

00:00:52.922 --> 00:00:54.229
fun option, no catch!

00:00:54.229 --> 00:00:55.925
All right next up, Jerry Jones for TREASON

00:00:55.925 --> 00:00:56.939
You are sentenced to watch football with

00:00:56.939 --> 00:00:57.552
those guys

00:00:57.552 --> 00:00:58.379
NOOO!

00:00:58.379 --> 00:00:59.989
BOOO! JERRY JONES! JERRY JONES!

